Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see\Nthe world While I'm on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've yet to reach the end So won't\Nyou come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm that you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey out to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you notice that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Vivi seem eager to go, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's because she's\Nfeeling like a pirate again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and here I thought she\Nwas becoming more refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Hina speaking, we just left Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm headed to Mariegeois as we speak,\NI'm traveling with the Nefertari family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hina, I got you flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I personally handpicked these for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw them away, now, full body,\NDjango, return to your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Before something terrible happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean breeze is so refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What if a gargantuan fowl\Nwere to snatch you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Or worse yet, if a sniper\Nhas his sights on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A stray meteorite could\Nalso plummet upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being such a worrywart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi was once a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's watching all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're indisposed, we can\Nturn the fleet around at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day I met Nico Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had some questions for the\Nworld government I'd like answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was to\Nlearn our true history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And to share it with the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to the Poneglyphs, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:05:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely why I am determined\Nto attend this year's referee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's at all possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to discover what the Nefertari\Nlineage did to the world many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, enough misbehavior, Princess Meavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, my dear father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If only my daughter would\Nmarry before I pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,using your illness to try and guilt me\Ninto marriage—we have piles of pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,pictures of potential suitors, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can toss them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your enthronement, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hotel prides itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,On being built exclusively\Nfor housing nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,who attend the reverie every four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We do hope you enjoy your stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't bad, but it isn't isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rather pedestrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Its only unique trait is that it offers\Na view of Gold Roger's execution stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're fatigued after your\Nlong journey here, King Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be gone from my room,\Nyou unsightly trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All countries of the\Nworld are currently abuzz
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,due to an event that happens\Nonce every four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In the holy land of Marie\NJoie called the reverie,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,here at this elite conference leaders\Nof 50 nations will gather together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to debate and negotiate matters\Nof concern from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,setting a course for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,these larger-than-life leaders\Ncan prove crafty and conniving,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so they often fail to see\Neye-to-eye, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The leader of the Haposui army,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don Chin Zhao, forgive me, I mean\NDon Sai, has yet to return, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Straw Hat and his allies\Ntook down the Doflamingo family,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy has been unable\Nto acquire additional arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, the war is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like we can make\Nit to the reverie after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There is quite a bit I'd like\Nto get off my chest this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Luffy made a promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time we get to meet in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he's taking me on a walk in\Na real forest on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that Luffy will make good\Non his word and take you all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid for this\Nparticular trip that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll only be directly\Nupwards to Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brothers, as well as the Neptune\Narmy, will gladly escort you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,now, now, dear one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, perhaps she should remain\Nhere while we all go. Latino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already wielded in\Na ton of signatures on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the petition to migrate to\NFishman Island after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as simple as that. If she stays,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that our actions\Nmay indicate to the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,humans that we don't entirely trust them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi, didn't you learn\Nanything from the Straw Hat crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This forthcoming meeting was the\Ngreatest desire of our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,King Wapol, bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The drum kingdom you\Nonce ruled over is now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,calling themselves the\NCherry Blossom Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears Dalton will be attending\Nthe reverie as their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a stupid name for a kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to put him in\Nhis place at the reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, Dr. Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't look so disappointed, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't travel\Nwithout a doctor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where I come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd really take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you'd serve as my attendant, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so exciting, Rebecca! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have whichever gown you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if I chose one my mom wore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds lovely to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, I turned down\Nthat naval fleet escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should travel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Elisabello, it's not a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, loosen up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The river is just a big party to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Luffy's group\Nfaces their own struggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn it starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, chopper, that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, every water do you wanna sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That big plunge from the\Nelephant wore us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're all suffering from trauma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Having nearly lost my life, you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To savor what I've got, on the\Nflip side, I'll murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We swerved a bit off course just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn to port, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! Look at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's perfectly fine! Do you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, we're really in the water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing looks ultra-heavy, but\Nit's colliding like it's in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrots here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mach!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bony!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we must take Yugara back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wada's gonna be so mad at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugara would rather be\Na nuisance to our saviors?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to go on an adventure\Nwith everyone just once in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean any harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're infiltrating the lair of an Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no game!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you, Tia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I won't cause any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I came prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:13:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought lunch, juice,\Na snack, and... a shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you Russians last you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say a good half day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea's pretty big, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you mean to take several\Ndays to reach the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Even going straight there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How can anything be so enormous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean truly is a wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be my first sleepover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no land to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're on board now, so\Nwe'll just have to make do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you thank for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you fear can eat my snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You should cut her head, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, you got a death grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're tough. Take\Nit. It's fine. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She almost took out Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,she is known for being a strong\Nfighter whoa where did you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,get up there pedro i suppose cats\Ndo like their heights man i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,hungry it's chow time somebody\Ngo make us some grog i guess this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is up to me then can you keep an\Neye on the water for me yes ma
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,'am okay it's five thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,berries per head
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you want
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,right Brooke maybe one of us should\Nstep up good thinking we can't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,possibly let Luffy handle this it\Nwould surely be a death sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,fine I'll cook you can leave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it to me I got this just watch
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, food, food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloopie, can you even use the stove?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, quite the headline today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-rumored mystery island
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,has finally been uncovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army's\Nheadquarters, Baltigo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,has been completely devastated?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The revolutionaries got\Nbeaten? Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon's your father, is he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a picture of my big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the details, but he's\Nthe one you ran into in Dressrosa, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, your brother is the chief of staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the second in command\Nin the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of family are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon guy beside him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember what your grandpa\Nsaid two years ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of your father is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, the Revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That man's your father, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my dad, this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You just realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's dad is the boss of the\NRevolutionary Army? So cool! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You never bothered to look him\Nup after you found out the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't even curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's so famous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin even said he took her\Nunder his wing for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First time seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad sure doesn't look like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope Sabo's okay. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he'd care\Nif he met him in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It says an anonymous tip led\Nto the discovery of their HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, by the time the\NNavian Cipher pole had arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the Blackbeard Pirates had brought the\Nlocation to utter ruin before fleeing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,blackbeard that bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i know i wonder what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,provoked him to attack the revolutionaries
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems strange he could\Nhas anything to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,sabo he fought that\Nchampion back in dress rosa
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Blackbeard fled After\Nbriefly butting heads with Cypherpoll
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, listen to\Nme, Luffy Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no mention of\Ncasualties in the article Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If your brother or father\Nhad been killed in the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,fight Their deaths would\Nhave at least made headlines,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I wouldn't worry Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy At least Ugarra can take solace\Nin that Oh, yeah, that's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Chopper? Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for cooking and everything,\Nbut is that smoke normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I left the stove on to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, there's a storm coming! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a retro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the fails, the wind\Nwill rip them to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the fire, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, the rain's gonna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky us, this is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give us a hand, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm family wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot went out to sea\Nwith the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't Yutia tell us sooner, Baratie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, Wanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really should have said something so\Nsomeone could have talked her out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But she told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If anybody finds out, they'll stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she pay Yutia off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I've been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me when I say Carrot\Ndidn't want to betray you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad to know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was more worried about\Nher being missing in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's with Luffy, she'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take your rest now, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have extra guards on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have suspicions that the\Nenemy possesses a Vivre card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but wonder\Nhow they obtained one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope the card was lost along\Nwith the fleet that Zunesha sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You do think they'll return?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we should stay vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pull me out of here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jack failed to rescue Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize that puts our\Narrangements for our smile tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Six feet under, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an emotional drunk today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means we won't be\Nable to create any more gifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.56,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you let yourself\Nget beaten like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised we'd make\Nthe greatest crew ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be filled with pirates\Nwith Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Before our dream could come true...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You got your ass handed to you\Nby a couple of piss-pant brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Joker, you dumb bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because you\Nwere such a weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This Straw Hat guy seems pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on then!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.44,0:24:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an angry drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.86,0:25:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Commander Kaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to lose your cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.82,0:25:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Worst Generation Trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.90,0:25:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They must think they're really\Nsomething taking down a Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But they've messed with my business,\Nand now they'll pay for it in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.42,0:25:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with those brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.56,0:26:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Warn your little playmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.98,0:26:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Run while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing pirate is going to get\Nyou and everyone you love killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass Captain Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The roof is patched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the storm has passed\Nand the ship is repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I saved the food. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, we get to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:26:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my signature curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.22,0:27:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, we can't eat rice\Nthat hasn't been cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is that bitter purple duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.78,0:27:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many bones in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.16,0:27:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And so much jam, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That blue sludge won't release my spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to you to deserve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.86,0:27:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to a lot of\Ntrouble to whip this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.32,0:27:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are being rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.88,0:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't eat this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to spill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji would be furious to find out\Nyou're wasting what's technically food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.72,0:27:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.12,0:27:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We had this place stocked with provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.98,0:27:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I kept on screwing things\Nup, so I used everything. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.44,0:27:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nearly a weak\Nsupply of food for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.90,0:27:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.76,0:27:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die of starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, on the first\Nday of Luffy's voyage,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.86,0:28:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the group is already waging a\Nbattle against malnutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was snow, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is le cotton candy fleury.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The transponderous nail's\Nbeen ringing off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.84,0:28:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a warning signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, meaning we have already entered\Nthe territory of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's broadcasting\Nover there, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.56,0:28:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oui, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As Le Snow says, this is Star 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It is an avant-post where a platoon of the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.68,0:28:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom pirates is\Nstanding at l 'attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.40,0:28:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If this was not airship, we would suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.12,0:29:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Les bombes, enfants, tragiques.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I do hope you have\Ndecided to be less stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.96,0:29:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And join notre Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's not just the big mom pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You would also be swearing allegiance\Nto the mighty German W6, n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.70,0:29:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then no one gets out and\Nyour dear papa is happy
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.02,0:29:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I give a crap\Nwhat that bastard wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.54,0:29:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I never want to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.40,0:29:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.92,0:29:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I only came to bring this to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be so antagonistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama is rather looking\Nforward to this arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course she is aware that you are some\Ncolleague of that imbecile Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But she thinks very highly\Nof you for your work at un
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.14,0:30:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,restaurant celebre in Lisbleu\Nwhere you were trained so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama may give you a highly desirable\Nposition if you can cook well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.48,0:30:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.00,0:30:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These hands have one job only.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.18,0:30:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's cooking for my crewmates\Nas long as they'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I went through hell itself to\Nbecome a better chef. All for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.14,0:30:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I bet they're missing\Nmy cooking as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stomachs growling with\Ntears in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.02,0:30:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.22,0:30:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You stabbed one of your own crewmates\Nin the back and didn't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.46,0:30:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Punks like that aren't worthy of my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, talking about Pec Homes,\Nwe let business get personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,B .G.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.61,0:30:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.68,0:31:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Vito!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.98,0:31:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a photo, Lili, of Lady Pudding\Nfrom Whole Cake Island for you to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.26,0:31:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.17,0:31:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not perfect, but I know you're\Nkind of iffy about this whole deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.96,0:31:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so at least you won't be going in blind\Nwhen you meet your betrothed, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not gonna be a wedding, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.22,0:31:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What difference does a photo make?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.18,0:31:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to kick you to death or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be cruel, Lelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.56,0:31:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fiancée, Lelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.62,0:31:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The 35th daughter of the Charlotte\Nfamily, Lady Charlotte Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
